{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/extras/desc_header_build.png?t=1745248376\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit heroes with unique skills and place them strategically on the field. Merge the same characters to level them up and get access to more powerful skills. Optimize your team and create strong synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/extras/buy_level_up_blue_bg.gif?t=1745248376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/extras/desc_header_fight.png?t=1745248376\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the battle starts, your characters will fight automatically and use their skills. Where they are on the battlefield determines the order of attacks and skills. Status effects like armor, poison, or bleeding make the combat even deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/extras/fight.gif?t=1745248376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/extras/desc_header_customize.png?t=1745248376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win battles to earn Unlock Tokens! Use these tokens to get new characters and add them to your custom deck. Find unexpected combinations and perfect your strategy. Share your decks with the community and friends \u2012 and try out their creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/extras/custom_deck.gif?t=1745248376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play against teams of other players:</strong>\u00a0Discover and learn new strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No turn timer:</strong> Take as much time as you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ranked and Casual mode:</strong> Play competitive or have a relaxing time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create custom decks:</strong>\u00a0Choose from dozens of unique characters </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639370?t=1745248376","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/a231ec9b7cd382296f49f3f594834be7aef4db85/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745248376","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/eb1b00a2e29076d655f630697b25814797949777/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745248376","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/eb1b00a2e29076d655f630697b25814797949777/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745248376","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/extras/desc_header_build.png?t=1745248376\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit heroes with unique skills and place them strategically on the field. Merge the same characters to level them up and get access to more powerful skills. Optimize your team and create strong synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/extras/buy_level_up_blue_bg.gif?t=1745248376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/extras/desc_header_fight.png?t=1745248376\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the battle starts, your characters will fight automatically and use their skills. Where they are on the battlefield determines the order of attacks and skills. Status effects like armor, poison, or bleeding make the combat even deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/extras/fight.gif?t=1745248376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/extras/desc_header_customize.png?t=1745248376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win battles to earn Unlock Tokens! Use these tokens to get new characters and add them to your custom deck. Find unexpected combinations and perfect your strategy. Share your decks with the community and friends \u2012 and try out their creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/extras/custom_deck.gif?t=1745248376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play against teams of other players:</strong>\u00a0Discover and learn new strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No turn timer:</strong> Take as much time as you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ranked and Casual mode:</strong> Play competitive or have a relaxing time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create custom decks:</strong>\u00a0Choose from dozens of unique characters </p></li></ul>","developers":["Mumpitz Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3405540","name":"Tiny Auto Knights"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639370/85c8f7f718ad8dbf5b2fc3961967fafb1b173f6d/header.jpg?t=1745248376","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124998,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124998/movie480.mp4?t=1744869255","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124998/movie_max.mp4?t=1744869255"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257124998/f57fd96a3fb7db823d120a78f8d4d34227e2932c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744869255","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124998/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744869255","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124998/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744869255"}}],"name":"Tiny Auto Knights Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any x86_64 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Full OpenGL 3.3 support<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operati